["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs introduces the first iPhone at Macworld 2007 --- REMASTERED and UPSCALED with AI to 4K multi-touch visual voicemail push IMAP cover flow\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2007-01-09-ch-debuggingthematrix-乔布斯定价iphone时的逻辑-别人的智能手机根本不是对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/26dfdde48ab52c34-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">DebuggingTheMatrix</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2007</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯定價iPhone時的邏輯：別人的智能手機根本不是對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯把iPhone定價在和普通iPod同樣的499美元，理由是這臺機器集齊了別的手機要花幾百美元才能單獨買到的功能，卻一分錢溢價都沒加。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品發布</span><span class=\"tag\">定價策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs&#x27; 2005 Stanford Commencement Address (with intro by President John Hennessy) Whole Earth Catalog\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2005-06-12-ch-stanford-乔布斯-被苹果开除-是我经历过最好的事情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/12db0bcde8d71255-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Stanford</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2005</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯：被蘋果開除，是我經歷過最好的事情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">30歲被自己創立的公司公開解僱後，喬布斯才進入人生最有創造力的五年，催生了NeXT和Pixar,最終帶著那段技術重新回到蘋果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業</span><span class=\"tag\">職業挫折</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs&#x27; CAUSE 1998 Annual Conference General Session white box PC thin client G.Lite\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1998-12-08-ch-retrobyte-乔布斯承认-去年最热门的十款游戏-一款都没在mac上运行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8191576fde4cfd79-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">RetroByte</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1998</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯承認：去年最熱門的十款遊戲，一款都沒在Mac上運行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯承認，蘋果連續多年沒能把任何一款當紅遊戲帶到Mac上，這個自我批評比他對外部競爭對手的任何評價都更直白。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">史蒂夫·喬布斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Apple Special Event 1998 (Full Keynote) | AppleArchivesPro Bytemark AGP (Advanced Graphics Port) USB (Universal Serial Bus)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1998-01-06-ch-wim-speelt-hd-full-乔布斯用跑分和实机对决-证明g3芯片以一半时钟频率打平奔腾ii/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dcb8a0c4dcf8645d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">26:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Wim Speelt Hd full</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1998</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯用跑分和實機對決，證明G3芯片以一半時鐘頻率打平奔騰II</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘋果沒有正面比較價格，而是現場把同價位甚至更貴的康柏筆記本和iMac拉上臺，用Photoshop和Director文件做計時賽，讓G3在觀眾眼前贏下每一局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">喬布斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Pixar&#x27;s early days: an interview with Steve Jobs (1996) Sillywood\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1996-11-22-ch-steve-jobs-archive-乔布斯说-pixar-权力结构是倒着的-ceo排在最底层/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f32a8de44a1dc2a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Steve Jobs Archive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1996</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯說：Pixar 權力結構是倒著的，CEO排在最底層</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為頂尖創意人才和頂尖圖形學人才都極度稀缺、隨時可能跳槽，喬布斯說 Pixar 的管理層必須倒著伺候他們，CEO反而成了最底層。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人才管理</span><span class=\"tag\">公司文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs: The Fresh Air Interview (1996) | Fresh Air object-oriented programming graphical user interface (GUI) blue box\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1996-02-22-freshair-乔布斯1996年预言-软件将彻底搬到网上下载-24个月内实现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bcc411a4204a4f9b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">31:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1996</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯1996年預言：軟件將徹底搬到網上下載，24個月內實現</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">離開蘋果後喬布斯反思：Next做硬件是重走成功老路，沒看清世界已變——真正值錢的不是圖形界面本身，而是網絡和面向對象編程這兩件他79年在Xerox沒看懂的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">Next</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Building NeXT from the ground up (PBS &quot;Entrepreneurs&quot;, 1986) reality distortion simulated learning environments\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1986-01-01-ch-steve-jobs-archive-乔布斯的现实扭曲-被自己团队当面反驳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/11ee91b1d295e29c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">20:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Steve Jobs Archive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1986</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯的現實扭曲，被自己團隊當面反駁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這期NeXT內部錄像罕見捕捉到員工當面告訴喬布斯：他標誌性的現實扭曲套路一旦影響到產品設計決策，就是團隊日後返工重來的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Steve Jobs</span><span class=\"tag\">NeXT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs presentation, around 1980 (Computer History Museum, gift of Regis McKenna) VisiCalc fictitious business name statement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1980-01-01-ch-computer-history-museum-乔布斯1980年演讲-苹果的使命是消灭人机之间的学习门槛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21aabaf2fa470162-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">23:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Computer History Museum</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1980</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯1980年演講：蘋果的使命是消滅人機之間的學習門檻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯認為蘋果真正要賣的不是硬件和軟件的數量，而是讓任何不懂編程的人都能直接解決問題，他相信這個門檻會在未來36個月內被攻破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">喬布斯</span>\n</div></div></a>"]